      },
      "text": "Demurrage and detention are not the same charge, and billing them as one line item is how importers overpay.\n\nDemurrage: the container is still inside the terminal past free time.\nDetention: the box left the terminal and the empty hasn't come back yet.",
      "url": "https://x.com/CandCWarehouse/status/2089528974376419395"
    },
