      "text": "You picked up the container, so why is there still a charge?\n\nGrab your popcorn, we'll explain it in 20 seconds.\n\nThis one is detention. It starts when you hold the shipping line's container too long after taking it out.\n\nDemurrage is at the port. Detention is outside it. Return https://t.co/KL4LYYwoi3",
