      },
      "text": "Your freight quote said one number. Your final invoice said another.\n\nDemurrage when your container waits at the port.\nDetention when it sits too long after pickup.\nDocument fees, handling fees, surcharges that only show up after booking.\n\nNone of it was in the quote. All of it https://t.co/Gva5VUri9q",
      "url": "https://x.com/WWL_Group/status/2084253821258367188"
